OL,3,AEx-OpenAI worker accused of planting
OL,4,Abug had Saudi support, claims
OL,5,Aprosecutors
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Saudi national charged with secretly
OL,8,Fplanting a recording device in one of
OL,9,FOpenAI's meeting rooms has been accused
OL,10,Fof having "considerable support" from
OL,11,Fthe Saudi government, according to a
OL,12,Fcourt filing in California.
OL,14,FUS prosecutors claimed Abdulrahman
OL,15,FAlfozan, who worked for the
OL,16,FChatGPT-maker, was in "frequent
OL,17,Fcommunication... with a member of the
OL,18,FSaudi royal family", and said a member
OL,19,Fof the country's military paid for a
OL,20,Fone-way flight to Saudi Arabia for his
OL,21,Fwife and son after his arrest.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
