OL,3,ARantzen felt 'deprived of choice' over
OL,4,Aher own death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA posthumous note written by Dame
OL,7,FEsther Rantzen said she was "deprived
OL,8,Fof any choice over my own death".
OL,10,FThe farewell message was released as
OL,11,Fthe 86-year-old broadcaster and
OL,12,Fcampaigner's family confirmed she had
OL,13,Fbeen laid to rest in an "incredibly
OL,14,Fbeautiful" private funeral last week.
OL,16,FThe Childline founder, who was
OL,17,Fdiagnosed with stage four lung cancer
OL,18,Fin 2023, died at her Bramshaw home in
OL,19,Fthe New Forest, Hampshire, on 30
OL,20,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
